images.prompt:
Use case: ui-mockup, product feature illustration.
Generate ONE NEW vertical portrait 2:3 image, a professional NINE-FRAME STORYBOARD contact sheet used to analyze a short video. Flat frontal charcoal #101317 analysis board, edge to edge; no device, no browser and no exterior mockup.
Input image role: style and story continuity reference only. Keep the same warm cinematic kitchen, same young East Asian woman with loosely tied black hair and ivory linen shirt, same silver gooseneck kettle and transparent ribbed glass of iced coffee on pale oak. Off-white typography and very restrained mint #b7e4ce analysis accents.
Top title exact "九宫格分镜". Small subtitle exact "把整条视频放在同一张图里".
The central 80% must contain EXACTLY NINE distinct movie frames in a perfectly regular THREE-COLUMN BY THREE-ROW grid. Nine cells, not eight, not ten. Moderate thin dark gutters. Each frame has a small but clear mint index at upper-left, "01" to "09", and a short white shot-language label below the picture.
Nine cinematic shots in reading order:
01 overhead close-up of dark coffee beans on a wooden spoon, label "俯拍";
02 extreme macro of coffee grounds falling from the grinder, label "微距";
03 medium shot of the woman preparing at the kitchen counter, label "中景";
04 close-up of her hand lifting the silver kettle, label "动作";
05 low-angle close-up of the kettle pouring into the clear glass, label "特写";
06 extreme macro of coffee liquid and ice in the ribbed glass, label "细节";
07 wide establishing shot of the sunny kitchen with the woman at the counter, label "全景";
08 medium portrait of her lifting the finished coffee, label "中近景";
09 close-up of her relaxed expression sipping the coffee near the window, label "情绪".
These must be nine genuinely different shot compositions and camera distances from the same short film; consistent story and props, not nine duplicates. Natural photographic quality, warm beige/golden highlights, no product logo.
Bottom beneath the complete grid, one quiet mint line connects nine tiny tick marks, caption exact "顺序 · 构图 · 叙事节奏". Keep the grid as large as possible and all nine frames fully visible inside 36px safe margins. This is a video breakdown storyboard visualization, not a decorative photo collage or an app dashboard full of small text.
